  "description": "Sometimes you just want to go for a “bike ride”. You don’t want a watered down version of a racing bike, or 30 gears. What you really want is a simple bike that keeps on working.\n\nWe designed the Flyer to be a non-intimidating bike that will inspire you with its ease-of-use every time you want to “go for a ride”. This 26 inch wheeled cruiser comes in two sizes to fit a wide range of riders. Confidence inspiring Continental Race King 2.2” wide tires are both fun and comfortable on almost any terrain. Keeping this bike simple is what makes it great!",
